:2211,"speakerName":"ソラヤー","textMapHash":2641306034,"text":"宝盗団はますます大胆になった…","nextNodeIds":[220090102]},{"nodeId":220090102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1791230170,"text":"探してる？","nextNodeIds":[220090103]},{"nodeId":220090103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"ソラヤー","textMapHash":546191090,"text":"うん、あなたに頼みたいことがあるからね。この前あなたが言ってた「宝児」なんだけど、調べてたら彼女は宝盗団の人だって確信したよ。","nextNodeIds":[220090104]},{"nodeId":220090104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"ソラヤー","textMapHash":2868133346,"text":"単独行動の原因は…宝物を独り占めしたいか、もしくは宝盗団の本隊のための先遣のどちらかだろうね。","nextNodeIds":[220090105]},{"nodeId":220090105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"ソラヤー","textMapHash":1717543914,"text":"ひとりは正体を隠しやすいしね、なにせ経験豊富な旅人も彼女に騙されたし。","nextNodeIds":[220090106]},{"nodeId":220090106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"ソラヤー","textMapHash":3304578642,"text":"これ以上彼女、そして宝盗団を放っておくと、周りの文物もきっと狙われるよ。","nextNodeIds":[220090107]},{"nodeId":220090107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"ソラヤー","textMapHash":3473190522,"text":"だから、それを止めてほしいの。完全に阻止できなくても、文物をできるだけ取り戻してほしいの。","nextNodeIds":[220090108,220090110,220090117]},{"nodeId":220090108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":776229522,"text":"分かった。","nextNodeIds":[220090109]},{"nodeId":220090109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"ソラヤー","textMapHash":960448410,"text":"では頼んだよ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":220090110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3745075402,"text":"どうして彼女たちの位置が分かったの？","nextNodeIds":[220090111]},{"nodeId":220090111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"ソラヤー","textMapHash":2757802538,"text":"私の推測が正しければ、宝盗団の人たちは私を尾行してるの。","nextNodeIds":[220090112]},{"nodeId":220090112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"ソラヤー","textMapHash":3268563218,"text":"私から直接奪うだけで、貪欲なあいつらはきっと満足しないと思う。","nextNodeIds":[220090113]},{"nodeId":220090113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"ソラヤー","textMapHash":2894232410,"text":"私が留まった場所なら、きっと彼らも何かないか探しにくるはずだよ。","nextNodeIds":[220090114]},{"nodeId":220090114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"ソラヤー","textMapHash":705548682,"text":"よく考えたら、居場所が分かるからね。でも私はただの学者だし、推理や判断はできるけど…","nextNodeIds":[220090115]},{"nodeId":220090115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"ソラヤー","textMapHash":1062271434,"text":"戦闘となると、やはり経験者の君に頼むしかないよ。","nextNodeIds":[220090116]},{"nodeId":220090116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"ソラヤー","textMapHash":58616298,"text":"お願い、あの文物たちを取り戻して。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":220090117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":297638586,"text":"すぐに倒すよ。","nextNodeIds":[220090118]},{"nodeId":220090118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"ソラヤー","textMapHash":796261138,"text":"待って、「止める」って言ったけど、すぐにあの宝児に問い質してほしくない。","nextNodeIds":[220090119]},{"nodeId":220090119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"ソラヤー","textMapHash":2598054202,"text":"宝盗団の組織はかなりゆるいけど、同時にその痕跡はつかみにくいの。せっかく君が繋がりを持ってるから、めったにないチャンスだよ。","nextNodeIds":[220090120]},{"nodeId":220090120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"ソラヤー","textMapHash":3466613250,"text":"彼女たちが「帰離原」に現れたのはきっと何か企みがあると思う。君が宝児のそばにいると、その計画を聞き出せるかもしれない。","nextNodeIds":[220090121]},{"nodeId":220090121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"ソラヤー","textMapHash":3642134514,"text":"だから、またバラしちゃだめだよ。君の実力を信じてるから、気付かれない場所を探して…速戦即決だよ。","nextNodeIds":[220090122]},{"nodeId":220090122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2211,"speakerName":"ソラヤー","textMapHash":619115226,"text":"文物を取り戻したらすぐに離れるようにね。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2200901,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],